wuzhu-q-o008","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7adf6fb487c32ced7646","layer":"original","quote":"八年〖20〗，权西伐黄祖，破其舟军，惟城未克；而山寇复动〖21〗，还过豫章，使吕范平鄱阳（会稽）〖22〗，程普讨乐安〖23〗；太史慈领海昏〖24〗，韩当、周泰、吕蒙等，为剧县令、长〖25〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗八年：建安八年（公元 203）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-89fa02f36b1a0d0955da","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o023","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-64b6e45c68fb16b80ee9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖复次于河上，绍病死。太祖渡河，击绍子谭、尚。而高幹、郭援侵略河东，关右震动。钟繇帅马腾等，击破之，语在《繇传》。八年〖4〗，太祖录彧前后功，表封彧为万岁亭侯。﹝一﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
